---
description: Routes software-engineering work through the FRAME methodology
alwaysApply: true
---

FRAME applies to requests to implement, change, extend, debug, or refactor code and systems. When a request combines explanation with a change, apply FRAME to the change.

For those tasks, use the `frame` skill and follow it through completion.

FRAME does not apply to purely informational questions, code explanations, or read-only search and inspection. Do not mention FRAME when it does not apply.

Do the work each stage requires; do not use stage names as a substitute for it.
